est","legend":"A sacred forest of Romian culture"},{"id":"marker22","name":"Ciema Pinery","legend":"A sacred pinery of Romian culture"},{"id":"marker23","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters"},{"id":"marker24","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters"},{"id":"marker25","name":"Torkburgh Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> Ⳳⳁ⳹ⳤⳄⳁ⳾ⲸⳚⳌⲲⲼⳃⳃⳊⲲⲸⳄⳌⳭⳢⳄ⳪⳥ⳃⳤⲸⳎⳞ⳹⳾⳹ⳒⳘⳜ⳾ⳐⳭⳃ  ⲲⳈⳈⳲⲸⳆⲴ</div>"},{"id":"marker26","name":"Caltondonbu Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠯᡔᠵᡰᡝᡜᠲ᠐ᠧᡝᠲᢐᠼᢢᡴᢓᡔᡙᡡᡝᢢᡒᢟᠩᠱᢦ᠀ᡎᢁᡕᢏᡟᢠᠨᠨᡲᡞᢤ᠀ᡏ᠑ᠻᠲᢠᡡᢦᡙᠭᢠᡐᢠᡐᡎᢡ᠀ᠽᡴᠰᠽᡭᠵᡙᢞᡡᢛᡟᠼᡒᡔᠱᡭᡎ</div>"},{"id":"marker27","name":"Skipton Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡱᢑᢦᢐᡐᠯᢑᡀᢏᢤᢂᠱᢐᢓᢤᠮᡗᡮᡗᠨᡲᢡᡳᡗᡳ᠒ᡏᠼᢑᢒᠳᠽᠿ᠐ᢀ᠒ᡒᠩᠿᢥᢠᢏᡱᠦᡒᠨᢢᡞᡡᡮ᠀ᡀᠩᡠᠯᠦᡕᠦᠧᡏᢏᠠᡝᡒ</div>"},{"id":"marker28","name":"Westcking Pillar","legend":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡎ᠐ᠽ᠐ᠠᡟᡠᠻᢀᢏᡍᠦᢦᡀᡯᡁᡱᠽᢒᢡᢞᠵᡲᡍᡔᡭᡮᠧᠩᡝᢂᡐᡓᢟᠿᡭᠨᡯᢛᠵᠦᡎᠪᠳᡭᢂ᠒᠑ᡠᡴᢡᢤᡙᢂᠠᠲᠭᢟ</div>"},{"id":"marker29","name":"Ruined Fortification","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortification. Untold riches may lie within"},{"id":"marker30","name":"Ruined Outpost","legend":"Ruins of an ancient outpost. Untold riches may lie within"},{"id":"marker31","name":"Ruined Pyramid","legend":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within"},{"id":"marker32","name":"Travelling Unmissable Circus","legend":"Roll up, roll up, this unmissable circus is here for a limited time only"},{"id":"marker33","name":"Calcerares Joust","legend":"Warriors from around the land gather for a joust of the greats in Calcerares, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor"},{"id":"marker34","name":"Apes migration","legend":"A huge group of apes is migrating, though whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary"},{"id":"marker35","name":"Dogs migration","legend":"A huge group of dogs is migrating, though whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary"},{"id":"marker36","name":"Jackals migration","legend":"A huge group of jackals is migrating, though whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary"},{"id":"marker37","name":"Camels migration","legend":"A huge group of camels is migrating, though whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary"},{"id":"marker38","name":"Stapsea performance","legend":"A performance has been organised at Stapsea as a chance to gather the great and the good of the area together to be merry, make alliances and scheme around the crisis"},{"id":"marker39","name":"Interdimensional Rift","legend":"A rumoured interdimensional rift in this area is causing cracks in reality itself to form."}]
